| -: | ------: | ---------: | -----------: | ----------: | --------: |
|  $N |       $N_REACH |         $GLITCHES |            $MEAN |           $MAX |         $MIN |

EOREPRO
# Section 4: Formatting and submission block
echo '<artisan_submit>'
